# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ondu Karaoke — local secrets for `wrangler dev`
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in your key.
# `.dev.vars` is how wrangler passes secrets to the Worker locally.
# In production use:  npx wrangler secret put YOUTUBE_API_KEY
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_api_key_here
